                      "fill": "$hz-text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "This page covers the third route: an internal application or SDK that calls a model API directly can point its base URL at the appliance instead of the provider. It is for code your teams write, not for people.",
